    "statement": "A laboratory controlled study found that pollen from genetically modified maize expressing Bacillus thuringiensis kurstaki (Btk) toxin did not reduce the growth of eastern tiger swallowtail or spicebush swallowtail caterpillars compared to non-genetically modified maize.",
    "citations": [
      "3895"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "No community response or behavior studies were reported in the evidence base regarding the effects of genetically modified maize expressing Bacillus thuringiensis kurstaki (Btk) toxin.",
    "citations": [
